<deviceset name="WCAP-FTX2_P10_CS" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:42235927/5" prefix="C">
<description>WCAP-FTX2 Film Capacitors

X2-Capacitors   

Characteristics
Product series for interference suppression
Self-healing properties
Certificates: ENEC 10 by VDE, cULus, CQC
Safety class: X2
Mounting style: Boxed THT
Dielectric: Polypropylene
Capacitance range: 5.6 nF ‒ 6.8 µF
Capacitance tolerance: ±10 %
Voltage range (UR): 275 V(AC)
Operating temperature: -40 °C up to + 105 °C
Pitch: 7.5 / 10.0 / 12.5 / 15.0 / 22.5 / 27.5 / 37.5 mm
Recommended soldering: Wave soldering

Applications
Safety applications
Filter
Interference suppression
e.g. EMI filter for power supplies

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WCAP-FTX2

Updated by Ella Wu 2023-10-30
2023(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
